  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Innovations for Reducing Plastics for a Cleaner Environment in India (INREPLACE) Activity</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this cooperative agreement is to reduce plastic pollution, including in the marine environment, through improvements in solid waste management and advancing a plastics circular economy in selected regions of India. Through the activity, USAID/India will partner with the Government of India (GOI) to address the plastic pollution challenge by (1) improving plastic and solid waste management planning, infrastructure, and services; and (2) addressing the life cycle impacts of plastics and other materials by promoting a circular economy.</narrative>
  </description>
